                "text": "Last night, I voted for H.R. 7666, the bipartisan Restoring Hope for Mental Health & Well-Being Act, which passed the House. Mental health is a serious issue & we need to provide resources & support to the millions of Americans struggling w/mental health & substance abuse crises.",
