                "text": "I have long supported advancements in maternal health care. I first heard of postpartum depression when a constituent I knew, Melanie Blocker Stokes, took her own life due her torturous experience with it. Such tragedies are preventable, & it is important to raise awareness. https://t.co/8lmLmS09ak",
